# Repos a reviewer of THIS repo may search and cite, materialized under
# .siblings/<owner>/<repo>. Declared rather than left to the fallback so
# the set is the one this repo actually depends on.
#
# One per line. The reviewer host must also carry a SOURCE_PATHS entry for
# each, or the sibling reports as `missing` and is never searched.
#
# Each row is a real edge: `plow` owns the API boot and the plugin call
# (PLOW_API_BASE: chats, agents, websocket, attachments) and publishes this
# image; `latch` serves the MCP tools and instructions boot/prompt.ts and
# boot/mcp-bridge.ts read through PLOW_MCP_URL; `agent-index-client` owns
# the agent_index_client.py the Dockerfile pins and boot/agent-index.ts runs;
# and `plow-agents` is the CLI the README tells owners to build, push and
# deploy this image with.

plow-pbc/plow
plow-pbc/latch
plow-pbc/agent-index-client
plow-pbc/plow-agents
